{"meta":{"id":"tt31613279","type":"series","name":"Amanda Knox: Una historia retorcida","imdb_id":"tt31613279","description":"Amanda Knox: Una historia retorcida narra la historia de una estudiante estadounidense que, tras llegar a Italia para estudiar en el extranjero, es encarcelada injustamente por asesinato. La serie explora su incansable lucha por demostrar su inocencia y recuperar su libertad, además de analizar por qué las autoridades y la opinión pública la juzgaron tan duramente.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt31613279.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iLzaLdkva7wUV9HMyykaHFUFHKA.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6WWbNAN9E3OKcIudWOzipzULG7o.png","genres":["Drama"],"releaseInfo":"2025","released":"2025-08-20T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Ended","imdbRating":"6.7","country":"United States of America","cast":["Grace Van Patten","Sharon Horgan","Francesco Acquaroli","Giuseppe De Domenico","John Hoogenakker","Roberta Mattei","Joe Lanza","Anna van Patten","Corinna Locastro","Fabio Salerno","Alfredo Pea","Stefano Cassetti","Federico Tocci","Evelyn Famà","Souleymane Seye Ndiaye","Viktorija Portnova","Cecilia Dazzi","Vincenzo De Michele","Mariagrazia Pompei","Rhianne Barreto","Bharti Patel","Dorian Lough","Rebecca Hazlewood","Nicholas Bishop","Francesca Alice Antonini","Manuela Tasciotti","Crosby Fitzgerald","Vincenzo Zampa","Angelo Libri","Antonio Rampino"],"writer":["K.J. Steinberg","Amanda Knox","Sam Rubinek","Nate Burke","Rebekah Barnett"],"trailers":[{"source":"_N5RC-vg2oM","type":"Trailer","name":"Tráiler Doblado","ytId":"_N5RC-vg2oM","lang":"es"},{"source":"KcY0Y95hMbM","type":"Trailer","name":"Official Trailer","ytId":"KcY0Y95hMbM","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"_N5RC-vg2oM","title":"Tráiler Doblado"},{"ytId":"KcY0Y95hMbM","title":"Official Trailer"}],"links":[{"name":"6.7","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt31613279"},{"name":"Drama","category":"Gen